<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<TXSPN>............
{PAUSE ""}
No... after all, it would be wrong of me to be a bother to <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> as well...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It is, after all, a dangerous thing to do.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "2000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"You're... right... I'm sorry... I got too carried away. There's no way it's all right for us to stick our noses in, whatever the case."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"No, it's fine. </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I understand how you feel too."</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "Lucky_You.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> smiled at me as though relieved.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"There are more important things than hunting for the culprit. We have to be properly prepared to accept </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I grinned back from ear to ear at <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"That's </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> for you, you say good things!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Like I keep saying, I always say good things!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The two of us laughed, hahaha.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somehow, it felt like I had not laughed in a very long time.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "900" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
We left Zahha behind and got on our bicycles.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Then I'll be going."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, see you!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "30"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> waved, and saw me off as I rode away on my bicycle.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
